  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nDark Return is a horror and mystery game that puts you in the role of John, a man who traveled far away in search of a cure. But his recovery journey is turned upside down when he receives a mysterious message from a family member, asking him to return home. Upon his return, he finds the house plunged into darkness, the family disappeared, and an atmosphere saturated with secrets and strange events.<p></p>\n<p>In the game, you will explore room after room in a house filled with family secrets. With each step, John discovers one horrific truth after another, and engages in uncovering mysterious details about what happened to the family, while a terrifying truth about his grandfather begins to emerge.</p>\n<p>Will you be able to discover the hidden truth? And can you confront the dark secrets that bind the family members?</p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>A unique horror experience featuring an exciting and complex story.\n</li><li>Fine graphics and details enhance the dark atmosphere of the game.\n</li><li>Intertwining puzzles that require exploration skills and concentration.\n</li><li>A mysterious ending that paves the way for an exciting sequel.\n</li></ul>\n",
